		"description": "Test collection for new endpoints implemented by bdiep:\n- GET /api/networks (vocabulary)\n- GET /api/statuses (vocabulary)\n- GET /api/shows (advanced search with filters)\n- GET /api/shows/random (random show)\n- GET /api/shows/:id (show by ID)\n\nThese tests cover all new functionality including:\n- Search and filtering\n- Pagination and sorting\n- Match logic (all/any)\n- Error handling (404, 400)\n- Data validation\n\nBase URL: http://localhost:8000 or https://tcss-460-group-7-tv-shows-dataset-api-g4kq.onrender.com",
